 "summary": "Mathlib has no kernel, ideal-extension or quotient results for `QuadraticAlgebra` (grep of `Mathlib/Algebra/QuadraticAlgebra` for `ker|Quotient|\u29f8` finds only `mker_norm_eq_unitary`), and no TauCeti declaration already covers this material. The new lemmas build on Mathlib's `algebraMap_dvd_iff`, `mapRingHom_surjective`, `ZMod.ker_intCastRingHom`, `Module.Basis.mem_smul_top_iff` and `RingHom.quotientKerEquivOfSurjective`, and the PR deletes the matching local facts in `PrimeIdeal.lean` in favour of the new public lemmas.",
